; Core runtime. Depends only on pure data libraries for the richer Postgres
; type mappings -- deliberately NO Caqti and NO Eio. The backend boundary lives
; in Sqlkit.Driver, and adapters implement it. That is what keeps Caqti out of
; generated code's public signatures.

(library
 (name sqlkit)
 (public_name sqlkit)
 (libraries ptime uuidm decimal yojson))
